      "id": 363949,
      "username": "Nelson",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2023-05-22T09:17:08.399Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi, im new in ERPNEXT, currently im installed with ERPNEXT v14.2.0 using cloudclusters.</p>\n<p>I’m facing a challenge with the sidebar menu, how can i edit or create a custom sidebar for my users.</p>\n<p>Example, i have a role with Store Manager, the menu available to him should be only :</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Stock</li>\n<li>Buying</li>\n</ol>\n<p>How can i create a custom section “Store Manager” and put this 2 modules under it, i can only create My Workspace, which is personalize to specific user, but i want to make the menu to relative user by specific role</p>\n<p>Also, how can i hide the public menu?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/3/5315204816a70351f6eec240cad89e406186a3e3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/5315204816a70351f6eec240cad89e406186a3e3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/5315204816a70351f6eec240cad89e406186a3e3_2_690x308.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"bQYTkNAcrhsNUNhH4DWsIghOLnl\" width=\"690\" height=\"308\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/5315204816a70351f6eec240cad89e406186a3e3_2_690x308.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/5315204816a70351f6eec240cad89e406186a3e3_2_1035x462.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/5/3/5315204816a70351f6eec240cad89e406186a3e3_2_1380x616.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F5F7F8\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1643×735 64.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
