      "created_at": "2023-05-22T09:30:08.889Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This user is admin user, it allowed for all modules</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9afb6c6be27a88a005b4762f78e0611273ea36c6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9afb6c6be27a88a005b4762f78e0611273ea36c6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9afb6c6be27a88a005b4762f78e0611273ea36c6_2_690x374.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"m72czMYkRN8QsNkqgWmfYpGDc7s\" width=\"690\" height=\"374\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/a/9afb6c6be27a88a005b4762f78e0611273ea36c6_2_690x374.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9afb6c6be27a88a005b4762f78e0611273ea36c6.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/a/9afb6c6be27a88a005b4762f78e0611273ea36c6.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFBFD\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1024×556 34.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>i can hide some module to show in menu by disable here, but how can i create a custom section of menu for specific role</p>\n<p>eg:</p>\n<p>Store Manager</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Stock</li>\n<li>Buying</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sales Admin</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CRM</li>\n<li>Selling</li>\n</ul>",
