      "cooked": "<p>Something like this, but this is in v13, im searched the official document, no related topic is found, only the custom workspace and workspace page.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1bebc454c63685f8427135b23856a6507e55c7a5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1bebc454c63685f8427135b23856a6507e55c7a5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1bebc454c63685f8427135b23856a6507e55c7a5_2_690x468.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"3Z01eRubbWHHeorBbOaOkmxN8A5\" width=\"690\" height=\"468\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1bebc454c63685f8427135b23856a6507e55c7a5_2_690x468.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/b/1bebc454c63685f8427135b23856a6507e55c7a5_2_1035x702.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/b/1bebc454c63685f8427135b23856a6507e55c7a5.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAF9FB\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1093×742 88.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>",
