      "id": 363957,
      "username": "mars",
      "name": "Marius Widmann",
      "created_at": "2023-05-22T09:47:31.354Z",
      "cooked": "<p>as far as i know there is no simple solution to that. you can restrict the roles and users to specific modules and doctypes ( read / write / create / … ), but then in the aftermatch  it is almost horrific to go through all the dependencies of each doctype per role and the dependent doctypes and it is a cascading chain of doctypes…</p>\n<p>setting it up is possible though i am not sure to what degree of perfection …</p>",
